    "content": "<p>Get ready to rumble. War Robots: Frontiers arrives onPlayStation&reg;5 and PlayStation&reg;4 in Asia with the launch of <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/210\">Season 2: Power Surge</a> on<strong> June 17! </strong>Players in <strong>Japan, Hong Kong, Indonesia, Malaysia, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan, </strong>and <strong>Thailand </strong>will be able to download and play War Robots: Frontiers for free from the PlayStation Store.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nJqvs_fl1kM\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/nJqvs_fl1kM?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=RrJBr\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<p>Prepare for electrifying battles with ferocious War Robots, charge into battle in multiple hair-raising game modes, boost your arsenal with Battle Passes, take control of towering Titans, and much more.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Along with the Sony Asia launch comes language support for <strong>Korean, </strong>complementing existing languages such as Japanese, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese, so all our Pilots can have an improved and tailored experience on the Wild Ten.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today and prepare for the electrifying Season 2: Power Surge on June 17:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S&trade;</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One&trade;</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://static.gc.my.games/WarRobotsFrontiersLoader.exe\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
